{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n\n<p>發佈時間：17:00 2026-10-16 HKT</p>\n<p>TVB台慶劇《璀璨之城》劇情掀起熱話，官孝賢（張智霖飾）與官孝君（吳卓羲飾）兩兄弟為家族接班人爭奪戰仍未正式展開，一幕又一幕的挑情戲，搶先跑出成為熱話！繼張智霖與陳曉華「壁咚」並伸手入裙底的一分鐘肉搏戲碼後，昨晚（15日）陳瀅與張智霖上演「腿張開」一幕，再度引起話題。飾演女記者霍佩樺Sarah的陳瀅為了與張智霖達成純粹的利益合作，不惜主動上演一幕極致大膽的「全裸誘惑」，大方展現身材任影唔嬲，火辣指數爆表，挑戰電視尺度，不過陳瀅的破格演出卻惹來AI疑雲。</p>\n<h2>陳曉華死亡USB引爆陳瀅寬衣戲碼</h2>\n<p>劇情講述陳曉華在死前，將錄有張智霖所有犯罪證據、黑材料及語音的USB寄出，引爆一場與舊愛玉石俱焚的「死亡USB遊戲」，但原來陳曉華已率先將存有黑材料的手機寄給陳瀅。疑心極重的張智霖得悉後試探陳瀅，陳瀅為了與張智霖達成利益交易，於陳曉華的家中見面時先交出手機並直接寬衣解帶。她先當面褪去外衣與牛仔褲，鏡頭先close up（特寫）她的臀部，接著僅穿黑色透視喱士內衣褲示人，隨後坐在床上除下黑色透視喱士內褲，繼而解開胸罩背扣，將身上衣物全數脫光。</p>\n<img alt=\"陳曉華將存有黑材料的手機寄給陳瀅，疑心極重的張智霖得悉後試探陳瀅。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/341866effee24201dd854df523ecad98/2026-10/VS--4--myTVSUPER-18_37_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳瀅為了與張智霖達成利益交易，見面時先交出手機。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/9de424f6f6c84f9891313000cd918532/2026-10/VS--4--myTVSUPER-39_07_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳瀅主動上演一幕極致大膽的「全裸誘惑」。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/83743d39e7bdff9a3ca23bbdcf29ea5a/2026-10/VS--4--myTVSUPER-40_20_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳瀅主動除衫。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ec2a0bf2664d3da794b445574fb1d008/2026-10/VS--4--myTVSUPER-40_34_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳瀅先露出黑bra。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/069c4b785d8fff50b28620a68d4e9886/2026-10/VS--4--myTVSUPER-40_39_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳瀅再除下牛仔褲。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c0a860436763614915049fcb334c21cf/2026-10/VS--4--myTVSUPER-40_42_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳瀅露出蜜桃臀。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b60bf2304a1174ede90d77d2272bf24f/2026-10/VS--4--myTVSUPER-40_43_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"張智霖一臉嫌棄。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d0a392d28d7c5b83b89ec34e6d6353ea/2026-10/VS--4--myTVSUPER-40_56_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳瀅繼續出招。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/af8eec1a8833823d1ededd8c650d96d9/2026-10/VS--4--myTVSUPER-41_01_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"張智霖冷眼看陳瀅下一步行動。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c1c10c13a7b96c17a14dcbb4ad8b6ee0/2026-10/VS--4--myTVSUPER-41_10_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳瀅準備坐在床上。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/cecd73e938289986dabac79ba39a60f3/2026-10/VS--4--myTVSUPER-41_11_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳瀅準備除下內褲。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/8149e85dc649e4f12896e9152e9fd23f/2026-10/VS--4--myTVSUPER-41_12_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"意識相當大膽。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d29a5dfd593bded778b4c5d294d82103/2026-10/VS--4--myTVSUPER-41_17_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳瀅解開胸罩背扣。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f4b85d35644c9fbb3f1b10702f44edce/2026-10/VS--4--myTVSUPER-41_21_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳瀅大晒玉背。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ccb8f8e39a22a94262b1e4541a6ac078/2026-10/VS--4--myTVSUPER-41_23_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳瀅盡騷一流身材。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/788683d4835a23c8b9991bcb0bc64722/2026-10/VS--4--myTVSUPER-41_24_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳瀅即將一絲不掛。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f6c2e91f929731a4b6aee6e1e55d2f7f/2026-10/VS--4--myTVSUPER-41_26_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳瀅將身上衣物全數脫光。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/aca8a442d4b89f2bc87ddb838be0aa61/2026-10/VS--4--myTVSUPER-41_29_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳瀅躺在床上腿張開。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/adefb06c8d8aaa2aa0d4695f5ba845b2/2026-10/VS--4--myTVSUPER-41_32_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳瀅任影唔嬲。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/7bfaf8f92d5af7d2835c6620e6a2455c/2026-10/VS--4--myTVSUPER-41_57_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"首次挑戰大膽除衫戲，陳瀅坦言現場緊張萬分。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/583bea3e5581a451cd8e3929fb751ac0/2026-10/VS--4--myTVSUPER-42_01_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳瀅又稱收到劇本已經很喜歡這場。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/cca90a71763a069064ec774e63063377/2026-10/VS--4--myTVSUPER-42_05_.jpg\"/>\n<h2>陳瀅自爆太緊張差點連底褲都除埋</h2>\n<p>首次挑戰大膽除衫戲，陳瀅坦言現場緊張萬分，更爆出拍攝時的驚險趣事：「拍第一個 Take 時因為太緊張，除褲時條底褲黐住咗，差啲一嘢成條除晒！嚇到攝影師哥哥大嗌慢慢嚟！」陳瀅又稱收到劇本已經很喜歡這場：「監製話放心好簡單，一個back shot（背影）上半身除衫露個背就得，但係我覺得呢場戲唔係sell性感，所以可以拍得大膽同深入啲，出嚟效果會更好。我為咗呢場戲，用咗9個月時間增肌減脂，不斷做gym，主打練下半身不停練patpat（臀部），本來我一直都冇乜自律做gym ，但係因為呢個角色，令我養成咗健康嘅生活習慣。」談到與張智霖首度合作，陳瀅大讚對方非常有默契，更爆料指辦公室挑逗那一幕，其實是 Chilam 嫌劇本不夠張力而親自「加料」大改劇本，加入了更多曖昧的挑逗互動，才成功營造出這幕張力十足的化學反應。</p>\n<h2>網民質疑陳瀅大尺度演出有AI嫌疑</h2>\n<p>陳瀅今次的演出在網上引來兩極化反應，有人讚陳瀅的演技大躍進：「今集mvp一定係陳瀅。」、「陳瀅今晚特別靚。」、「陳瀅氣質脫俗獨特絕靚爆鏡。」、「可以喎！陳瀅好過陳曉華。」不過亦有人覺得張智霖拎手機多角度近距離拍攝，加上撥開雙腿一幕，令畫面充斥男性凝視，有矮化女性之嫌：「寫到女人只係識靠上床。」、「咸色之城！」、「拍電視啫駛唔駛呀？拍電影咪要用內窺鏡？」、「我都覺得係點解冇挑逗嘅成份，即使佢除晒啲內衣褲，我只係覺得好似阿婆除內衣咁，想點先？」、「呢個時段播啲咁嘅嘢，撞啱一家人食緊飯，有男有女大有細，非常尷尬！」還有人覺得整場戲有AI合成之嫌：「啲腳趾咁嘅？？？？（像AI生成的腳趾）」、「好AI味，如果係真嘅，就要檢討點解拍出嚟浸味咁假。」、「一定係，因為上身同下身係兩種色！深淺色好明顯！」、「明明陳瀅個身型都肥肥哋，除晒衫邊有咁靚。」</p>\n<img alt=\"陳瀅曾因為易胖體質，飽受網民批評。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c156eb5c421e451697224fb268e77304/2022-12/JEA84.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳瀅擁有好身材。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/439baf4e6fc770d1ccb1d8ab6e5f46db/2022-12/JEA86.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳瀅好Fit。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/5f86783053ac2813d66fbadf9c0516a6/2022-12/JEA87.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳瀅有不少泳款都大露背。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/25db25e86b22ae5428ba01f1c36a7ee4/2023-08/VideoScreenshot--JEANNIEmissjniInstagramphotosandvideos-0_01_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳瀅穿幼帶比堅尼盡騷一流身材。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/7b27980463d68f85bb1f568e00328e28/2025-10/3_12.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳瀅曾帶愛犬到海灘。​\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/1cec19cdc2b29b0117edb08fa3f8c5d5/2023-01/jin31.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳瀅在日落下拍照留念。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/4a49efe290654ef0012ff1e90878132a/2024-10/509.png\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳瀅近來愛以真空打扮上陣。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/dc65de0d04d1f2ff6dff756814961805/2025-02/JEANNIE_13_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳瀅瘦身後鍾意晒玉背。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/47b0553afb63b789c4f83829b825b985/2025-02/JEANNIE_12_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳瀅身材好誘人。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/3a464b3cd6ca933a1b784555309e7726/2023-04/unknown_306625565_772863237126090_7218071822818294894_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳瀅未有公開感情生活。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/154d5ac15253ca82d70a0721ad01327d/2024-09/JEANNIE_65_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳瀅擁有逆天長腿，不時大派福利。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/7ef58049d8059bde83597117b149b851/2026-05/IMG_9868.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳瀅入行數年已經成為TVB一線花旦。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/8be4741efd1b368d00629c28d9ade86e/2023-01/jin51.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳瀅的比堅尼泳衣，包不住她的豐滿上圍，非常性感。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f821fd4b7b4a3153f1171853a5919d25/2026-06/3928686747325740919_801727.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳瀅在吊床上曬日光浴，甚識享受。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/191e7efae07c011d9497156212544006/2026-06/3928686774395810063_801727.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳瀅在泳池嬉水，背影相當誘惑。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/95c4c4af83a75dac4be4518539203db7/2026-06/3928686813906077064_801727.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳瀅回頭展示甜美笑容，俘虜不少網民。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/7ab098461d753c92b87871f8ff6279dc/2026-06/3928686820432482918_801727.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳瀅的居家Look，是網民近期喜愛的打扮之一。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c222ee69764a0b95024b36402e3c4bb6/2022-12/JEA83.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳瀅的社交網有不少泳照。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/6ee48fbfdaa6815449cf1a8a4043b764/2022-12/JEA79.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳瀅不時派福利。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/04e811f92b0da6dd4eae5ae23334457b/2023-06/JC006%20%282%29.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳瀅大晒三點式。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e416db7bc8ac5c412308d76a154cb14e/2022-12/JEA81.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳瀅越來越Fit。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e359bc498dcc8b9dfe292bbd86561858/2024-07/missjni_1722149756_3421962639150770001_801727.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳瀅於IG上載性感靚相。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/767cf4d7566efa858612f11c7d1bb9f7/2026-01/1_10_13.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳瀅穿上低胸閃銀晚裝。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/83bd7939f0f68a3d05630c06168510c3/2026-01/2_9_24.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳瀅穿上黑絲。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/a82c89c542171f153f6001955a5c20b0/2026-01/3_55.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳瀅展現高貴性感。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/28f2d84b8f5e370049927ca28d72e7fb/2026-01/4_0_19.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳瀅眼神嫵媚。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/bd2e33fd47e69b0abec5e04aee9a8d22/2026-01/tt1.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳瀅渾身散發女人味。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/32426e3af8989c2eb63ebcd201319c7c/2026-01/TT3.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳瀅身材極佳。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ea2abe4fb4cfcbeee4724419006b192c/2026-01/TT4.jpg\"/>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-16T10:19:51.322297+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1255,"images":51,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-16T09:00:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-16T12:57:59.655879+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-16T10:17:43.240085+00:00","content_hash":"34b68fac4de84eb0d642541cdc59e7aff9cf1699c3c4165e838b0dab640aeb20","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}